<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44495" root="&#xA;                        ودع&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدُعَ</span></b> 
                        , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدْعٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعَةٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He</i> (a man, S,) or <i>it,</i> (a thing, TA,) <i>became
still, quiet,</i> or <i>at rest;</i> (S, K, TA;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّدَعَ</span></b> , (K, TA,) [quasi-] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُدْعَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُدَعَةٌ</span>.
(TA.) You say to a man, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنَّدَعْ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَدَّعْ</span></b> 
meaning <i>Be thou grave, staid, steady, sedate,</i> or
<i>calm.</i> (TA.) See also 1; and art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وذر</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدُعَ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدَعَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدَاعَةٌ</span>, <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, in
a state of ease, and ampleness of the means</i> or
<i>circumstances of life.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْ</span>: see an
ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذَى</span>: it may be rendered, in different
cases, <i>Leave thou,</i> or <i>let alone,</i> or <i>say nothing
of:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلْهَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْنِى مِنْ كَذَا</span>
                        <i>Let me alone and
cease from such a thing:</i> and <i>exempt thou me,</i>
or <i>excuse me, from such a thing.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْ عَنْكَ كَذَا</span>
                        <i>Dismiss thou from thee such a thing.</i> See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُذْ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْكَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْ مَا يَرِيبُكَ إِلَى لَا يَرِيبُكَ</span>: see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ريب</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعْ مَا زَيْدٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِىٌّ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سوى</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b8- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدَعَ</span> used as a pret.: see an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَائِلَةٌ</span>, in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زول</span>.

